>>
Rule 1 (tensor must have floating-point or complex dtype to avoid out_dtype error)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 2 (tensor must be at least 2-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 3 (last two dimensions must form a positive-size square matrix)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2)
>>
Rule 4 (all batch dimensions, if present, must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 then ndim(v_1) - 3 else -1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (name should not be the literal "none")
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 ≠ "none"
